* LCNS1 -- Licensing report screen
MAP LCNS1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD USERID    AT 0,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD UNRPTCNT  AT 5,30  LEN 8  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FRDATE    AT 6,30  LEN 20 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD TODATE    AT 6,54  LEN 20 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 10,5  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
